module fizzbuzz
edition 0
needs console


to main, needs console:
    for each n in from 1 to 15:
        if n mod 15 equals 0:
            show "FizzBuzz"
        otherwise if n mod 3 equals 0:
            show "Fizz"
        otherwise if n mod 5 equals 0:
            show "Buzz"
        otherwise:
            show n
